  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/209",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">이 단원을 배워야하는 이유에 대해 지구계의 구성요소가 서로 상호작용하고있기때문에 <br>지구 온도 상승으로인해 지권, 수권, 기권, 생물권이 모두 영향을 받는 것이다. 이로 인해 우리 인간의 삶도 위협받고있다. <br>따라서 우리는 지구계의 구성요소를 아는 것 부터 시작해 어떤식으로 영향을 주고받는지, 각각의 구성 요소에서 일어나는 일들에 대해 배우게된다. 라고 도입했습니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebb821f53ba2a4a540bf8ca3523b25397218604c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebb821f53ba2a4a540bf8ca3523b25397218604c\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d30b470b1c1711b1cf8094f0057707cc94226544\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d30b470b1c1711b1cf8094f0057707cc94226544\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a87318c7d70f4fe627170a655c7c4070582c531\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a87318c7d70f4fe627170a655c7c4070582c531\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f593334ef602fffd99c68bcd99dee44ab668111\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f593334ef602fffd99c68bcd99dee44ab668111\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47e5d5e03c817ec1f6058a5b65c72d52a32ed802\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47e5d5e03c817ec1f6058a5b65c72d52a32ed802\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f0c0904cb95ec7ff3cfb754cf3f9b552f900ac3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f0c0904cb95ec7ff3cfb754cf3f9b552f900ac3\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b84ae834eb20cc738b6d544b9e52e69968f3c96d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b84ae834eb20cc738b6d544b9e52e69968f3c96d\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/275e1cd9ba6bd977c15a435846bd39b7eb882bb6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/275e1cd9ba6bd977c15a435846bd39b7eb882bb6\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/121d5eb0ca7648e6a4471366730287d7d475156e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/121d5eb0ca7648e6a4471366730287d7d475156e\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6d5a1d7b3f878b7d16eea07138806d42f802712\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a6d5a1d7b3f878b7d16eea07138806d42f802712\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>이렇게 수업을 2차시에 걸쳐 진행했고요.<br>1차시는 지구계의 구성요소를 분류해보는 활동까지,<br>2차시는 분류한 결과를 발표하고 지권, 기권, 수권, 생물권으로 다시 분류해보는 활동을 진행했습니다.<br><br>발표를 하면서 화면으로 띄워주고 학생들이 잘 분류했는지 피드백하는 과정을 거쳤습니다.<br>아이들이 잘못 알고있는 개념도 바로잡고 기권, 지권, 수권, 생물권, (외권)으로 분류하는게 제일 나은 것 같다는 의견도 나오고 했습니다~ <br>중학교 1학년이라 발표도 적극적으로하고 활동에도 잘 참여해서 저도 재미있는 수업이었네요~ <br><br><br>아래는 학생들의 작품입니다~ <br>너네가 너무 잘해줘서 자랑할거라고하니 마음껏 올려달라고 하네요..ㅎㅎ <br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5a4f1c211dfa9e7a7c73a5189421c0c49eccf31\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5a4f1c211dfa9e7a7c73a5189421c0c49eccf31\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/91d450160c2820bdefc55e605d96f96bfca0be73\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/91d450160c2820bdefc55e605d96f96bfca0be73\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/793f2cf898fcdd54f421e0efbdb1497e235c7189\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/793f2cf898fcdd54f421e0efbdb1497e235c7189\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3c4a50f5fe7543c7130e74dc04804d72246d996\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3c4a50f5fe7543c7130e74dc04804d72246d996\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
